 of the ucc so we  look to the owner to to pay off  if they don't pay off or cannot pay off  or it's a hardship of some sort we work  with them and like i said i think  earlier we have a small percentage of  our portfolio that is  serviced via ach and not on bill some in  some cases those are folks who  um uh uh had to sell it and and and  under a hardship scenario but in most  cases they are paying us off at sale or  we simply won't clear  our ucc or or deed of trust off the  title and that  messes up the the transaction presuming  it's not a cash transaction  and this is allison i think what's been  interesting for us to see over the last  year perhaps an obvious uh  piece but the the shifts in this book  have really um trended with the overall  residential markets and so we've seen a  lot of prepayments actually happening  and homeowners have been able to  refinance fairly quickly so for us it'll  be interesting to see with the book that  remains how that continues to perform  since we had such a high rate of  prepayment at the beginning of this  thanks guys uh so we are out of time  this is going to be the last question um  but thank you uh everyone giving us so  many uh so many good questions so this  one comes from skye and john and it's  for john  um and you're both wondering a little  bit about a little bit more detail about  the free  um  process so the the post construction  advisory service  what exactly that service entails  right  when construction concludes sometimes  participants can find themselves  still a bit  in difficulty on understanding what  their legal  rights are and how to make sure that the  contracting is going as they wish  to make sure that the financing is  performing as they  had intended or if they want to now seek  some restructuring of how to do that and  then finally uh to make sure that the uh  that the performance  um  of the equipment and of the management  strategies the distributed generation  and so on are doing their job properly  and in that vein the free team offers a  multi-dimensional  team that can come in and help on all  three funds legal financial  and energy slash technology it is a  small fee that is  uh if it's at the choice of the  participant but it can be included in  the proceeds of the financing and uh  and paid off that way or there can be a  separate uh  consultancy that's set up for that  purpose um so far folks like to just  put it in the  in the proceeds of the finance  great thanks for that uh so that is all  the time we have uh for today uh i'd  like to thank bruce burt john adam and  alison for a really great presentation  uh we covered a lot of ground  and had a lot of great questions from  the audience so i'd like to thank  everyone for listening in and being part  of the presentation  i'd like to remind everyone that today's  talk will be made available online  through the yale center for business and  the environment website and our itunes u  page  we hope you'll join us for the next  blueprint for efficiency webinar in a  week's time it'll be co-hosted with the  council for development finance  authorities the cdfa  and we'll be looking at accessing  creative revenue sources for energy  efficiency  this is michael puckett from the gale  center for business and the environment  saying so long from new haven  connecticut
 

